- the **parent** process: browser UI, launches and brokers all other processes, not sandboxed;
- `webIsolated=<site>`: web content tied to one site (Fission);
- `webCOOP+COEP=<site>`: cross-origin isolated pages that may use `SharedArrayBuffer`;
- `file`: pages from `file://` URLs, less sandboxed than other content processes;
- `extension`, plus GPU, **RDD** (remote data decoder: media decoders in their own sandboxed process) and utility processes.

